  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2022-07-25T19:29:08.599Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I struggle to see the point in adding EAC to VRChat. Sure, it would prevent harmful mods, but you are hitting a large part of the user base just by adding EAC. That and without even telling the community about it? Why am I not allowed to use the OpenVR FSR mod? This mod literally has allowed me to have a smoother experience in VRChatv Pavlov and Into the Radius. Is the trade off really worth it?",
